# App tier: dev servers (nextjs, make serve), chat apps. No limits and no
# ManagedOOMPreference, so these are what systemd-oomd kills first; builds
# and terminals are "avoid". oomrun also gives them oom_score_adj 500 for the
# kernel OOM killer (oomd ignores adj).
[Unit]
Description=oomrun app tier (killed before builds)
